{
  "_about": [
    "Typed-line examples, shared by every implementation that reads them.",
    "The Writer macro (tools/run_macro_test.py) and the JavaScript core",
    "(addin/core, node --test) both read this file, so a case added for one",
    "is a case for both. Each group keeps the shape the macro suite's check",
    "for it expects; the comment above the group in run_macro_test.py says",
    "what that check asserts. 'why' records the bug a case was added for.",
    "The 'parsed' section is the macro's own parse of every case, written by",
    "LINGUEXX_UPDATE_GOLDEN=1 python3 tools/run_macro_test.py -- read it",
    "before committing it, like any golden."
  ],
